# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and in checkouts.
# The generated marketing documents (docs/marketing/UTM-*.md|.csv) are
# byte-compared by `npm run validate`, so CRLF checkouts (Windows with system
# core.autocrlf=true) would break validation. This file keeps every clone
# consistent. See AGENTS.md.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
